  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Under Schedule 2, Part 3, M.2(1)(a) of Class M Part 3 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended), prior approval is required and refused as a number of the proposed flats do not meet the relevant Minimum Gross Internal Floor Areas (as specified in The Nationally Described Space Standard 2015) for the accommodation shown on the drawings (for example Flat 3 is indicated as being a 1 bedroom 1 person flat with a GIA of 37.8sqm whereas the accommodation as shown on the drawings is a 1 bedroom 2 person flat which has a minimum GIA requirement of 50sqm, therefore a shortfall of 12.2sqm below the necessary standard).",
    "The proposed development, as a result of no Unilateral Undertaking being secured to prevent future occupiers from applying for resident parking permits within the Controlled Parking Zone, would result in unacceptable impacts on highway function and safety, contrary to Paragraph 116 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024, Policy T4 of the London Plan 2021 and, Policies DM9 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012."
  ],
